{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y的音乐细节和情绪变化的颗粒度不如X，尤其是旋律起伏、声部关系、情绪悬而未决等细微过程，X捕捉得更丰富，也更有时间上的层次。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的左右分工比较有效：左边用完整、连贯的话交代人物在想什么、为什么这样想，右边用短词补充身体感受和情绪质地，普通观众比较容易一边听音乐一边跟上故事。X的【】强调能帮助抓重点，而且音乐感受更细密、更有即时变化，但短语数量过多、切换频繁，部分感受还比较抽象，容易让观众忙于扫词而顾不上理解人物关系的推进。整体而言，Y更容易让人听懂一个完整的人物心理过程，X则在音乐感受的细腻程度上胜出。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "637b21ee-2252-4bde-8954-7077c66e7cdb", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T061103470839Z", "elapsed_seconds": 23.89, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T06:11:27.367119+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0634387b3db33ae982048801dd1275501dc6698d7573a82402a822a347954ae2", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683",